This License does not require Modified Versions to be identical to the Original Version.

Publishers may add, remove, replace, or modify functionality, provided that the resulting Modified Version continues to comply with the attribution requirements of this License.

Nothing in this License transfers ownership of the Original Version or its original copyright to a modifier.

## 7. Commercial Use

This License does not prohibit commercial use of the Software or Modified Versions, provided that all applicable requirements of this License are followed.

## 8. No Requirement to Publish Source

This License does not require a publisher to release the source code of a Modified Version unless another applicable agreement separately requires it.

However, if source code is published, the applicable copyright and attribution notices required by this License must remain with it.

